# `data/*` rather than `data/`: git cannot re-include a file inside an excluded
# DIRECTORY, so the negation below is silently ignored under the directory form.
# The provenance record has to be tracked — nothing in the repo said where the
# Kaggle dataset came from until it existed. See data/README.md.
data/*
!data/README.md

